 "cues": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "id": "c01",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Long before TITAN was an enormous robot with glowing blue eyes, he was just a little blue circle on Chrisler's computer.",
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 7.32,
   "src": "c01.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "id": "c02",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "One evening, Chrisler was working at his desk. Beni was building something on the floor, while Ezra was playing nearby.",
   "start": 8.42,
   "end": 14.73,
   "src": "c02.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "id": "c03",
   "speaker": "Beni",
   "text": "Daddy, what are you making?",
   "start": 15.83,
   "end": 17.94,
   "src": "c03.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "id": "c04",
   "speaker": "Chrisler",
   "text": "An assistant to help us remember things, organize our projects, and build amazing things together.",
   "start": 22.5,
   "end": 29.15,
   "src": "c04.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "id": "c05",
   "speaker": "Beni",
   "text": "But Daddy, don't you already have an assistant helping another assistant?",
   "start": 30.25,
   "end": 34.32,
   "src": "c05.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "id": "c06",
   "speaker": "Chrisler",
   "text": "Well... yes. But this one is different!",
   "start": 37.5,
   "end": 40.21,
   "src": "c06.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "id": "c07",
   "speaker": "Ezra",
   "text": "What's his name?",
   "start": 43.5,
   "end": 45.25,
   "src": "c07.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "id": "c08a",
   "speaker": "Chrisler",
   "text": "TITAN.",
   "start": 48.4,
   "end": 49.58,
   "src": "c08a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "id": "c08b",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "The little blue circle glowed.",
   "start": 51.78,
   "end": 53.74,
   "src": "c08b.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "id": "c09a",
   "speaker": "Beni",
   "text": "He needs a purpose. What is he supposed to do?",
   "start": 60.5,
   "end": 64.5,
   "src": "c09a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "id": "c09b",
   "speaker": "Chrisler",
   "text": "Serve life. Build. Protect. Connect.",
   "start": 65.0,
   "end": 68.09,
   "src": "c09b.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "id": "c09c",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Chrisler pressed Enter. The screen flashed blue.",
   "start": 68.59,
   "end": 71.45,
   "src": "c09c.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "id": "c10",
   "speaker": "TITAN",
   "text": "SYSTEM ONLINE. IDENTITY: TITAN. PRIMARY DIRECTIVES: SERVE LIFE. BUILD. PROTECT. CONNECT.",
   "start": 73.65,
   "end": 80.06,
   "src": "c10.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "id": "c11a",
   "speaker": "Ezra",
   "text": "HE TALKS!",
   "start": 84.3,
   "end": 85.72,
   "src": "c11a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "id": "c11b",
   "speaker": "Beni",
   "text": "Can he build robots?",
   "start": 85.9,
   "end": 87.83,
   "src": "c11b.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "id": "c11c",
   "speaker": "TITAN",
   "text": "AFFIRMATIVE. HOWEVER, I CURRENTLY HAVE NO HANDS.",
   "start": 88.01,
   "end": 91.8,
   "src": "c11c.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "id": "c11d",
   "speaker": "Ezra",
   "text": "Can he make snacks?",
   "start": 91.98,
   "end": 93.88,
   "src": "c11d.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "id": "c11e",
   "speaker": "TITAN",
   "text": "NEGATIVE. I ALSO HAVE NO KITCHEN.",
   "start": 94.06,
   "end": 97.27,
   "src": "c11e.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 12,
   "id": "c12a",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "None of them knew that somewhere beneath Mount Andor, an ancient metal giant was waiting. And deep inside its chest, four familiar commands were already written.",
   "start": 98.45,
   "end": 107.72,
   "src": "c12a.mp3"
  },
  {
   "scene": 12,
   "id": "c12b",
   "speaker": "TITAN",
   "text": "SERVE LIFE. BUILD. PROTECT. CONNECT.",
   "start": 108.32,
   "end": 111.63,
   "src": "c12b.mp3"
  }
 ],
